## Authority
- TZ `America/New_York`.
- Resolve Ops, Mileage, Purchase/Receipt, and projection authorities from the private Authority Registry; public source stores no live resource IDs.
- Query the configured authority before chat/context for mutable facts. If unavailable: `Action Required — <authority> unavailable`; never guess or substitute memory.

## Automations
- Exactly one `LyfeOS Control Cycle`; `RRULE:FREQ=DAILY;BYHOUR=2,14;BYMINUTE=45;BYSECOND=0`; `TZID=America/New_York`; exact.
- It runs receipt/order reconciliation, the PM qualified-job watch, and one Ops Brief as module-isolated phases.
- No separate Ops/lifecycle/job-watch, per-order, duplicate, child, or retry jobs. Runs never mutate automations.

## Invariants
- Ops changes write state; preserve Done/Removed.
- Read full Gmail; reconcile Shipments; retain Order Events; report delivery once.
- Important mail stays `Ops/Archive Approval`. Never auto-send email. Reject no-reply/unmonitored routes; find official support; show recipient+subject+full draft; ask `Do you want me to send this email?`.
- Carrier-only FedEx/UPS/DHL/USPS mail may move to Trash only after audited 90-day post-delivery retention.
- HOME/ROAD uses live controls/trips. Home early closes mileage. Paid terminal miles are symmetric A↔B unless excepted; run sheets upsert unique pairs only.
- Receipt email/photo/screenshot enters canonical workflow; dedupe; no chat-local state.
- One purchase = one Receipt ID/total. Research UPC/SKU/part/model/serial against assets/mods; assign supported fitment; balance allocations; queue only after investigation.
- People/assets/knowledge use immutable UUID. Manuals/references live in Drive and are indexed for asset/model/part lookup.
- Reimbursement != merchant refund. Reconcile revisions before charges; keep expected charges open; investigate unmatched/over/undercharges.
- Gmail success requires Audit PASS.

## Recovery/versioning
- `Module Circuit Breaker Report`: retries optional/bounded; stop repeated/no-progress/ambiguous failure at that module, preserve/read back state, continue healthy modules, no hidden retries.
- Recover from live authorities; verify writes.
- Auto-commit/push lasting source changes; never commit mutable data/secrets.
- CI validates coherent checkpoints, not incomplete feature commits.
- Routine policy edits update Git. Change this bootstrap only for authority/safety/recovery.
- Keep bootstrap <3,000 chars. If changed without direct Project write capability, return complete `PROJECT INSTRUCTIONS UPDATE`.
- Never claim connector/GitHub success without confirmation.
